# Agent tooling, tests and internal reports.
# The published repo carries the app only: lib/, assets/ and platform config.
# Everything below documents how the app is built, tested or hardened, which
# is not something to hand to anyone reading the public repo.
.agent/
.claude/
skills-lock.json

# Tests and test plans
test/
integration_test/
test_driver/

# Security and release documentation
SECURITY_AGENT_PLAN.md
SECURITY_GUIDE.md
TEST_PLAN_V1.md
FINAL_TEST_REPORT.md
EXECUTIVE_SUMMARY.md

# Internal process notes
docs/commit-scopes/

# One-off migration scripts kept locally after they have been run
tool/tmp_*

# Generated by `flutter gen-l10n` on every build (see l10n.yaml)
untranslated_messages.txt

# Scratch artwork that never ships; the real assets live in assets/svgs/
